# Links (reference/common/links.md). Page area of 260 × 260 from (20, 20); with FixedMetrics, each
# character measures 5 pt at Size: 10 and each line, 12. A link does not change the layout: what is
# checked here are the positions, and that the PDF is written with its annotations (the PNG does not
# show them; PdfCanvasTest and StackingContextTest do).
#
# Page 1, from top to bottom, each box with a bottom margin of 8 pt: mail (Text with Link mailto:) at
# 20, of 12; md (a Markdown with a link to a URL and another to mail, "Visita la web o vuelve al
# inicio.", 33 characters: one line of 12) at 40; logo (an Image of 150 × 75 with Link to end) at
# 60; card (a Block with Link to end, with a padding of 4 and two lines of text: 12 + 12 + 8 = 32) at
# 143. Page 2: end, the target of logo and card, at 20; back, with Link to mail, at 32.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Page:
		Width: 300
		Height: 300
		Margin: 20
	Title: Enlaces
	Language: es
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
	Section:
		Text: Escribe a soporte@airemas.example
			Id: mail
			Link: mailto:soporte@airemas.example
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
		Markdown:
			Id: md
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
			Content >>
				Visita [la web](https://stxt.dev) o vuelve al [inicio](#mail).
		Image: test/wide.png
			Id: logo
			Alt: Logotipo
			Link: #end
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
		Block:
			Id: card
			Link: #end
			Box:
				Padding: 4
			Text: Primera línea
			Text: Segunda línea
		Block:
			Break:
				Before: page
			Text: Destino de los enlaces
				Id: end
			Text: Volver al principio
				Id: back
				Link: #mail
